const G_SECS=[['每週單字','每週單字測驗','只登記平時分數'],['檢測','英文檢測','A 卷／B 卷'],['數學檢測','數學檢測','單元・檢測 1～4'],['單字檢定','單字檢定','基礎 1–8・成長 1–10'],['國小認證','國小認證','認證測驗'],['all','全部成績','依測驗／學生／清單']];
const VOCAB_LEVELS=[...Array.from({length:8},(_,i)=>'基礎'+(i+1)),...Array.from({length:10},(_,i)=>'成長'+(i+1))];
let gView='exam',gSec='每週單字',gClass='',gSubject='',gMonth='',gEntryDate=today(),gExtraDates=[],gExtraUnits=[];
const gMax=g=>+g.maxScore>0?+g.maxScore:100;
const gPass=g=>g.passScore!==''&&g.passScore!=null&&!isNaN(+g.passScore)?+g.passScore:Math.round(gMax(g)*(g.paper==='B'?0.6:0.8)*10)/10;
const gClassOf=g=>g.classId||student(g.studentId)?.classId||'';
const gKey=g=>[g.section||'',g.date,g.title,g.paper||'',g.subject,gClassOf(g)].join('|');
const gTitle=g=>g.title+(g.paper?' '+g.paper+' 卷':'');
function gInfer(g){if(!g.section){const t=String(g.title||'');g.section=/單字檢測|每日單字|每週單字|^\d+\.\d+/.test(t)?'每週單字':/^(基礎|成長)\s*\d+|認讀/.test(t)?'單字檢定':/認證/.test(t)?'國小認證':'檢測';}
 if(g.section==='檢測'&&!g.paper){const m=String(g.title||'').match(/^(.*?\S)\s*([AB])$/i);if(m){g.title=m[1].trim();g.paper=m[2].toUpperCase();}}
 if(g.section==='單字檢定'){const m=String(g.title||'').match(/^(基礎|成長)\s*(\d+)/);if(m)g.title=m[1]+m[2];}if(g.paper==null)g.paper='';}
function gStatus(g){if(g.exempt)return ['exempt','— 不用考'];if(g.absent)return ['absent','○ 缺考'];if(g.passed)return ['good','✓ PASS 通過'];const v=scoreOf(g);if(v==null)return ['none','未登記'];if(v>=gPass(g))return ['good','✓ 及格'];if(v>=gMax(g)*0.6)return ['mid','△ 待加強'];return ['low','✕ 未及格'];}
const gPct=g=>{const v=scoreOf(g);return v==null||g.exempt||g.absent||g.passed?null:Math.max(0,Math.min(100,v/gMax(g)*100));};
function gradeRows(sec=gSec){return data.grades.filter(g=>(sec==='all'||g.section===sec)&&(!gClass||gClassOf(g)===gClass)&&(!gSubject||g.subject===gSubject)&&(!gMonth||String(g.date).startsWith(gMonth))&&gradeSearchMatch(g));}
function gExams(rows){const m=new Map();rows.forEach(g=>{const k=gKey(g);if(!m.has(k))m.set(k,{key:k,date:g.date,title:gTitle(g),subject:g.subject,section:g.section,classId:gClassOf(g),max:gMax(g),pass:gPass(g),rows:[]});m.get(k).rows.push(g);});
 return [...m.values()].sort((a,b)=>String(b.date).localeCompare(String(a.date))||String(a.title).localeCompare(String(b.title),'zh-Hant',{numeric:true}));}
function gSummary(rows){const numeric=rows.filter(g=>gPct(g)!=null),scored=rows.filter(g=>gPct(g)!=null||g.passed&&!g.exempt&&!g.absent),good=scored.filter(g=>gStatus(g)[0]==='good').length,avg=numeric.length?Math.round(numeric.reduce((a,g)=>a+gPct(g),0)/numeric.length):null;return {scored:scored.length,good,avg,rate:scored.length?Math.round(good/scored.length*100):null,follow:scored.filter(g=>gStatus(g)[0]!=='good').length,absent:rows.filter(g=>g.absent&&!g.exempt).length,exempt:rows.filter(g=>g.exempt).length};}
const gBar=(pct,passPct,tip)=>'<div class="track" title="'+esc(tip)+'">'+(pct==null?'':'<div class="fill" style="width:'+pct.toFixed(1)+'%"></div>')+(passPct==null?'':'<div class="passline" style="left:'+passPct.toFixed(1)+'%" aria-hidden="true"></div>')+'</div>';
function gRow(g,e){const st=gStatus(g),v=scoreOf(g),pct=gPct(g),s=student(g.studentId),a=attOn(g.studentId,g.date);
 return '<div class="srow"><div class="sname">'+esc(sLabel(s))+(a&&needWhy(a)?' '+attChip(a):'')+(g.note?'<div class="help">'+esc(g.note)+'</div>':'')+'</div>'+gBar(pct,e.pass/e.max*100,sLabel(s)+'：'+(v==null?st[1]:v+' / '+e.max+'（'+Math.round(pct??0)+'%）')+'　及格線 '+e.pass)+
 '<div class="sval">'+(v==null||g.exempt?'<small>—</small>':v+'<small> / '+e.max+'</small>')+'</div><div class="sst"><span class="st '+st[0]+'">'+st[1]+'</span></div><div class="sact"><button class="iconbtn" data-edit="'+esc(g.id)+'" aria-label="編輯 '+esc(s?.name||'')+' 成績">編輯</button><button class="iconbtn danger" data-grade-delete-one="'+esc(g.id)+'" aria-label="移除 '+esc(s?.name||'')+' 成績">✕</button></div></div>';}
function gExamCards(rows,emptyText){const exams=gExams(rows);if(!exams.length)return '<div class="panel empty">'+emptyText+'</div>';
 return '<div class="gexams">'+exams.map(e=>{const sm=gSummary(e.rows),order=[...e.rows].sort((a,b)=>byNum(student(a.studentId)||{},student(b.studentId)||{})),sc=e.rows.filter(g=>gPct(g)!=null).map(scoreOf),avg=sc.length?Math.round(sc.reduce((x,y)=>x+y,0)/sc.length*10)/10:'—';
  return '<section class="panel gexam"><div class="gexam-head"><div><h3>'+esc(e.title||'未命名評量')+'</h3><div class="help">'+esc([e.date,gSec==='all'?e.section:'',e.subject,e.classId?className(e.classId):'','滿分 '+e.max,'及格 '+e.pass].filter(Boolean).join(' · '))+'</div></div><div class="gstat"><div><strong>'+avg+'</strong><small>平均分數</small></div><div><strong>'+(sm.scored?sm.good+'/'+sm.scored:'—')+'</strong><small>及格人數</small></div><button class="iconbtn" data-gexam="'+esc(e.key)+'" title="整班補登或修改這次測驗">整班編輯</button><button class="iconbtn danger" data-grade-delete-exam="'+esc(e.key)+'">刪除整次測驗</button></div></div><div class="srows">'+order.map(g=>gRow(g,e)).join('')+(()=>{const has=new Set(e.rows.map(g=>g.studentId)),miss=(e.classId?classStudents(e.classId):[]).filter(st=>!has.has(st.id)).map(st=>[st,attOn(st.id,e.date)]).filter(([,a])=>isLeaveAtt(a));return miss.length?'<div class="sleave"><b>當天請假／缺席，未登記成績：</b>'+miss.map(([st,a])=>esc(st.name)+' '+attChip(a)).join('　')+'</div>':'';})()+'</div></section>';}).join('')+'</div>';}
